('srd35_magic_scabbard_of_keen_edges','Scabbard of keen edges','magic_item',16000,16000,'This scabbard is fashioned from cured leather and fine silver. It can shrink or enlarge to accommodate any knife, dagger, sword, or similar weapon up to and including a greatsword. Up to three times per day on command, the scabbard casts keen edge on any blade placed within it.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"16,000 gp","roll_result":"59","raw_table_row":["59","Scabbard of keen edges","16,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_figurine_of_wondrous_power_golden_lions','Figurine of wondrous power, golden lions','magic_item',16500,16500,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 16,500 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"16,500 gp","roll_result":"60","raw_table_row":["60","Figurine of wondrous power, golden lions","16,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_chime_of_interruption','Chime of interruption','magic_item',16800,16800,'This instrument can be struck once every 10 minutes, and its resonant tone lasts for 3 full minutes.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"16,800 gp","roll_result":"61","raw_table_row":["61","Chime of interruption","16,800 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_broom_of_flying','Broom of flying','magic_item',17000,17000,'This broom is able to fly through the air as if affected by*an overland flight* spell (average maneuverability) for up to 9 hours per day (split up as its owner desires). The broom can carry 200 pounds and fly at a speed of 40 feet, or up to 400 pounds at a speed at 30 feet. In addition, the broom can travel alone to any destination named by the owner as long as she has a good idea of the location and layout of that destination. It comes to its owner from as far away as 300 yards when she speaks the command word. The broom of flying has a speed of 40 feet when it has no rider.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"17,000 gp","roll_result":"62","raw_table_row":["62","Broom of flying","17,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_figurine_of_wondrous_power_marble_elephant','Figurine of wondrous power, marble elephant','magic_item',17000,17000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 17,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"17,000 gp","roll_result":"63","raw_table_row":["63","Figurine of wondrous power, marble elephant","17,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_amulet_of_natural_armor_3','Amulet of natural armor +3','magic_item',18000,18000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 18,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"18,000 gp","roll_result":"64","raw_table_row":["64","Amulet of natural armor +3","18,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_ioun_stone_iridescent_spindle','Ioun stone, iridescent spindle','magic_item',18000,18000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 18,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"18,000 gp","roll_result":"65","raw_table_row":["65","Ioun stone, iridescent spindle","18,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_bracelet_of_friends','Bracelet of friends','magic_item',19000,19000,'This silver charm bracelet has four charms upon it when created. The owner may designate one person known to him to be keyed to one charm. (This designation takes a standard action, but once done it lasts forever or until changed.) When a charm is grasped and the name of the keyed individual is spoken, that person is called to the spot (a standard action) along with his or her gear, as long as the owner and the called person are on the same plane. The keyed individual knows who is calling, and the bracelet of friends only functions on willing travelers. Once a charm is activated, it disappears. Charms separated from the bracelet are worthless. A bracelet found with fewer than four charms is worth 25% less for each missing charm.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"19,000 gp","roll_result":"66","raw_table_row":["66","Bracelet of friends","19,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_carpet_of_flying_5_ft_by_5_ft','Carpet of flying, 5 ft. by 5 ft.','magic_item',20000,20000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 20,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"20,000 gp","roll_result":"67","raw_table_row":["67","Carpet of flying, 5 ft. by 5 ft.","20,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_horn_of_blasting','Horn of blasting','magic_item',20000,20000,'This horn appears to be a normal trumpet. It can be sounded as a normal horn, but if the command word is spoken and the instrument is then played, it deals 5d6 points of sonic damage to creatures within a 40-foot cone and causes them to be deafened for 2d6 rounds (a DC 16 Fortitude save reduces the damage by half and negates the deafening). Crystalline objects and creatures take 7d6 points of sonic damage, with no save unless they’re held, worn, or carried by creatures (Will DC 16 negates).','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"20,000 gp","roll_result":"68","raw_table_row":["68","Horn of blasting","20,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_ioun_stone_pale_lavender_ellipsoid','Ioun stone, pale lavender ellipsoid','magic_item',20000,20000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 20,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"20,000 gp","roll_result":"69","raw_table_row":["69","Ioun stone, pale lavender ellipsoid","20,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_ioun_stone_pearly_white_spindle','Ioun stone, pearly white spindle','magic_item',20000,20000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 20,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"20,000 gp","roll_result":"70","raw_table_row":["70","Ioun stone, pearly white spindle","20,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_portable_hole','Portable hole','magic_item',20000,20000,'A portable hole is a circle of cloth spun from the webs of a phase spider interwoven with strands of ether and beams of starlight. When opened fully, a portable hole is 6 feet in diameter, but it can be folded up to be as small as a pocket handkerchief. When spread upon any surface, it causes an extradimensional space 10 feet deep to come into being. This hole can be picked up from inside or out by simply taking hold of the edges of the cloth and folding it up. Either way, the entrance disappears, but anything inside the hole remains.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"20,000 gp","roll_result":"71","raw_table_row":["71","Portable hole","20,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_stone_of_good_luck_luckstone','Stone of good luck (luckstone)','magic_item',20000,20000,'This stone is typically a bit of rough polished agate or some similar mineral. Its possessor gains a +1 luck bonus on saving throws, ability checks, and skill checks.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"20,000 gp","roll_result":"72","raw_table_row":["72","Stone of good luck (luckstone)","20,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_figurine_of_wondrous_power_ivory_goats','Figurine of wondrous power, ivory goats','magic_item',21000,21000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 21,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"21,000 gp","roll_result":"73","raw_table_row":["73","Figurine of wondrous power, ivory goats","21,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_rope_of_entanglement','Rope of entanglement','magic_item',21000,21000,'A rope of entanglement looks just like any other hempen rope about 30 feet long. Upon command, the rope lashes forward 20 feet or upward 10 feet to entangle a victim. An entangled creature can break free with a DC 20 Strength check or a DC 20 Escape Artist check.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"21,000 gp","roll_result":"74","raw_table_row":["74","Rope of entanglement","21,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_golem_manual_stone','Golem manual, stone','magic_item',22000,22000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 22,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"22,000 gp","roll_result":"75","raw_table_row":["75","Golem manual, stone","22,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_mask_of_the_skull','Mask of the skull','magic_item',22000,22000,'This ivory mask has been fashioned into the likeness of a human skull. Once per day, after it has been worn for at least 1 hour, the mask can be loosed to fly from the wearer’s face. It travels up to 50 feet away from the wearer and attacks a target assigned to it. The grinning skull mask makes a touch attack against the target based on the wearer’s base attack bonus. If the attack succeeds, the target must make a DC 20 Fortitude save or be struck dead, as if affected by a finger of death spell. If the target succeeds on his saving throw, he nevertheless takes 3d6+13 points of damage. After attacking (whether successful or not), the mask flies back to its user. The mask has AC 16, 10 hit points, and hardness 6.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"22,000 gp","roll_result":"76","raw_table_row":["76","Mask of the skull","22,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_mattock_of_the_titans','Mattock of the titans','magic_item',23348,23348,'This digging tool is 10 feet long. Any creature of at least Huge size can use it to loosen or tumble earth or earthen ramparts (a 10-foot cube every 10 minutes). It also smashes rock (a 10-foot cube per hour). If used as a weapon, it is the equivalent of a Gargantuan +3 adamantine warhammer, dealing 4d6 points of base damage.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"23,348 gp","roll_result":"77","raw_table_row":["77","Mattock of the titans","23,348 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_circlet_of_blasting_major','Circlet of blasting, major','magic_item',23760,23760,'On command, this elaborate golden headband projects a blast of searing light (5d8 maximized for 40 points of damage) once per day.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"23,760 gp","roll_result":"78","raw_table_row":["78","Circlet of blasting, major","23,760 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_amulet_of_mighty_fists_2','Amulet of mighty fists +2','magic_item',24000,24000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 24,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"24,000 gp","roll_result":"79","raw_table_row":["79","Amulet of mighty fists +2","24,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_cloak_of_displacement_minor','Cloak of displacement, minor','magic_item',24000,24000,'This item appears to be a normal cloak, but when worn by a character its magical properties distort and warp light waves. This displacement works similar to the displacement spell except that it only grants a 20% miss chance on attacks against the wearer. It functions continually.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"24,000 gp","roll_result":"80","raw_table_row":["80","Cloak of displacement, minor","24,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_helm_of_underwater_action','Helm of underwater action','magic_item',24000,24000,'The wearer of this helmet can see underwater. Drawing the small lenses in compartments on either side into position before the wearer’s eyes activates the visual properties of the helm, allowing her to see five times farther than water and light conditions would allow for normal human vision. (Weeds, obstructions, and the like block vision in the usual manner.) If the command word is spoken, the helm of underwater action creates a globe of air around the wearer’s head and maintains it until the command word is spoken again, enabling her to breathe freely.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"24,000 gp","roll_result":"81","raw_table_row":["81","Helm of underwater action","24,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_bracers_of_archery_greater','Bracers of archery, greater','magic_item',25000,25000,'These wristbands look like normal protective wear. The bracers empower the wearer to use any bow (not including crossbows) as if she were proficient in its use. If she already has proficiency with any type of bow, she gains a +2 competence bonus on attack rolls and a +1 competence bonus on damage rolls whenever using that type of bow. Both bracers must be worn for the magic to be effective.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"25,000 gp","roll_result":"82","raw_table_row":["82","Bracers of archery, greater","25,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_bracers_of_armor_5','Bracers of armor +5','magic_item',25000,25000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 25,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"25,000 gp","roll_result":"83","raw_table_row":["83","Bracers of armor +5","25,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_cloak_of_resistance_5','Cloak of resistance +5','magic_item',25000,25000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 25,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"25,000 gp","roll_result":"84","raw_table_row":["84","Cloak of resistance +5","25,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_eyes_of_doom','Eyes of doom','magic_item',25000,25000,'These crystal lenses fit over the user’s eyes, enabling him to cast doom upon those around him (one target per round) as a gaze attack, except that the wearer must take a standard action, and those merely looking at the wearer are not affected. Those failing a DC 11 Will save are affected as by the doom spell. If the wearer has only one lens, the DC of the saving throw is reduced to 10. However, if the wearer has both lenses, he gains the additional power of a continual deathwatch effect and can use fear (Will DC 16 partial) as a normal gaze attack once per week.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"25,000 gp","roll_result":"85","raw_table_row":["85","Eyes of doom","25,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_pearl_of_power_5th_level_spell','Pearl of power, 5th-level spell','magic_item',25000,25000,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 25,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"25,000 gp","roll_result":"86","raw_table_row":["86","Pearl of power, 5th-level spell","25,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_maul_of_the_titans','Maul of the titans','magic_item',25305,25305,'This mallet is 8 feet long. If used as a weapon, it is the equivalent of a +3 greatclub and deals triple damage against inanimate objects. However, the wielder must have a Strength of at least 18 to wield it properly. Otherwise, she takes a –4 penalty on attack rolls.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"25,305 gp","roll_result":"87","raw_table_row":["87","Maul of the titans","25,305 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_strand_of_prayer_beads','Strand of prayer beads','magic_item',25800,25800,'This item appears to be a normal string of prayer beads until the owner casts a divine spell. Once that occurs, the owner instantly knows the powers of the prayer beads and how to activate them. Each strand includes two or more special beads, each with a different magic power.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"25,800 gp","roll_result":"88","raw_table_row":["88","Strand of prayer beads","25,800 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_cloak_of_the_bat','Cloak of the bat','magic_item',26000,26000,'Fashioned of dark brown or black cloth, this cloak bestows a +5 competence bonus on Hide checks. The wearer is also able to hang upside down from the ceiling, like a bat.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"26,000 gp","roll_result":"89","raw_table_row":["89","Cloak of the bat","26,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_iron_bands_of_binding','Iron bands of binding','magic_item',26000,26000,'When initially discovered, this very potent item appears to be a 3-inch-diameter rusty iron sphere with bandings on the globe.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"26,000 gp","roll_result":"90","raw_table_row":["90","Iron bands of binding","26,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_cube_of_frost_resistance','Cube of frost resistance','magic_item',27000,27000,'This cube is activated or deactivated by pressing one side. When activated, it creates a cube-shaped area 10 feet on a side centered on the possessor (or on the cube itself, if the item is later placed on a surface). The temperature within this area is always at least 65°F. The field absorbs all cold-based attacks. However, if the field is subjected to more than 50 points of cold damage in 1 round (from one or multiple attacks), it collapses into its portable form and cannot be reactivated for 1 hour. If the field absorbs more than 100 points of cold damage in a 10-round period, the cube is destroyed.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"27,000 gp","roll_result":"91","raw_table_row":["91","Cube of frost resistance","27,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_helm_of_telepathy','Helm of telepathy','magic_item',27000,27000,'The wearer can use detect thoughts at will. Furthermore, he can send a telepathic message to anyone whose surface thoughts he is reading (allowing two-way communication). Once per day, the wearer of the helm can implant a suggestion (as the spell, Will DC 14 negates) along with his telepathic message.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"27,000 gp","roll_result":"92","raw_table_row":["92","Helm of telepathy","27,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_periapt_of_proof_against_poison','Periapt of proof against poison','magic_item',27000,27000,'This item is a brilliant-cut black gem on a delicate silver chain. The wearer is immune to poison, although poisons still active when the periapt is first donned still run their course.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"27,000 gp","roll_result":"93","raw_table_row":["93","Periapt of proof against poison","27,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_robe_of_scintillating_colors','Robe of scintillating colors','magic_item',27000,27000,'The wearer of this robe can cause the garment to display a shifting pattern of incredible hues, color after color cascading from the upper part of the robe to the hem in sparkling rainbows of dazzling light. The colors daze those near the wearer, conceal the wearer, and illuminate the surroundings. It takes 1 full round after the wearer speaks the command word for the colors to start flowing on the robe. The colors create the equivalent of a gaze attack with a 30-foot range. Those who look at the wearer are dazed for 1d4+1 rounds (Will DC 16 negates). This is a mind-affecting pattern effect.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"27,000 gp","roll_result":"94","raw_table_row":["94","Robe of scintillating colors","27,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_manual_of_bodily_health_1','Manual of bodily health +1','magic_item',27500,27500,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 27,500 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"27,500 gp","roll_result":"95","raw_table_row":["95","Manual of bodily health +1","27,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_manual_of_gainful_exercise_1','Manual of gainful exercise +1','magic_item',27500,27500,'Listed in Table: Medium Wondrous Items; market price 27,500 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"27,500 gp","roll_result":"96","raw_table_row":["96","Manual of gainful exercise +1","27,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
