('srd35_magic_dimensional_shackles','Dimensional shackles','magic_item',28000,28000,'These shackles have golden runes traced across their cold iron surface. Any creature bound within them is affected as if a dimensional anchor spell were cast upon her (no save). They fit any Small to Large creature. The DC to break or slip out of the shackles is 30.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"28,000 gp","roll_result":"01","raw_table_row":["01","Dimensional shackles","28,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_figurine_of_wondrous_power_obsidian_steed','Figurine of wondrous power, obsidian steed','magic_item',28500,28500,'Listed in Table: Major Wondrous Items; market price 28,500 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"28,500 gp","roll_result":"02","raw_table_row":["02","Figurine of wondrous power, obsidian steed","28,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_drums_of_panic','Drums of panic','magic_item',30000,30000,'These drums are kettle drums (hemispheres about 1-1/2 feet in diameter on stands). They come in pairs and are unremarkable in appearance. If both of the pair are sounded, all creatures within 120 feet (with the exception of those within a 20-foot-radius safe zone around the drums) are affected as by a fear spell (Will DC 16 partial). Drums of panic can be used once per day.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"30,000 gp","roll_result":"03","raw_table_row":["03","Drums of panic","30,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
